oy">Dmitry of Moscow</a> defeats <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mamai">Mamai</a> at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-kulikovo">Battle of Kulikovo</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1395</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/timur">Timur</a> defeats <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tokhtamysh">Tokhtamysh</a> on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/terek-river">Terek</a> and sacks <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sarai">Sarai</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1480</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/great-stand-on-the-ugra-river">Great Stand on the Ugra River</a> ends <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/moscow">Moscow</a>'s tribute</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1502</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/menli-i-giray">Meñli I Giray</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/crimea">Crimea</a> defeats the last khan and sacks <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sarai">Sarai</a></span></li></ol>
